                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "frame",
                      "id": "1mJF2",
                      "name": "Article Content",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "layout": "vertical",
                      "gap": 24,
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "0WH1R",
                          "name": "intro",
                          "fill": "$text-secondary",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "Java 泛型是 JDK 5 引入的一个重要特性，它提供了编译时类型安全检测机制，让程序员能够在编译时检测到非法的类型。本文将深入探讨 Java 泛型的核心概念和实际应用。",
                          "lineHeight": 1.8,
                          "fontFamily": "Inter",
                          "fontSize": 16,
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "iMk88",
                          "name": "heading1",
                          "fill": "$text-primary",
                          "content": "1. 什么是泛型",
                          "lineHeight": 1.4,
                          "fontFamily": "Inter",
                          "fontSize": 22,
                          "fontWeight": "600"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "iarNV",
                          "name": "para1",
                          "fill": "$text-secondary",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "泛型（Generics）是一种在定义类、接口和方法时使用类型参数的机制。通过泛型，我们可以编写更加通用、类型安全的代码，同时减少强制类型转换的需要。",
                          "lineHeight": 1.8,
                          "fontFamily": "Inter",
                          "fontSize": 16,
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "frame",
                          "id": "IoYCn",
                          "name": "Code Block",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "fill": "#1E1E1E",
                          "cornerRadius": 8,
                          "layout": "vertical",
                          "padding": 20,
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "id": "96oJL",
                              "name": "codeLine1",
                              "fill": "#9CDCFE",
                              "content": "public class Box<T> {",
                              "lineHeight": 1.6,
                              "fontFamily": "Menlo",
                              "fontSize": 14,
                              "fontWeight": "normal"
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "id": "Lbdsl",
                              "name": "codeLine2",
                              "fill": "#9CDCFE",
                              "content": "    private T content;",
                              "lineHeight": 1.6,
                              "fontFamily": "Menlo",
                              "fontSize": 14,
                              "fontWeight": "normal"
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "id": "36uvr",
                              "name": "codeLine3",
                              "fill": "#9CDCFE",
                              "content": "    ",
                              "lineHeight": 1.6,
